flowchart TB
  U[Submitted URL] --> A[URL acquisition extension<br/>Write HTML + multiple images<br/>Return Artifact[]]
  A <-->|write / Artifact| N[Artifact writer<br/>write(mediaType, origin, bytes)<br/>Returns one stored Artifact per call]
  A -->|Artifact[]| H[Trusted host ingestion<br/>Assign IDs / hash / store bytes<br/>Complete Input atomically]
  B[Files / folders / pasted text<br/>Browser capture with bytes] -->|bypass URL acquisition| H
  H -->|Input: stored originals only| P[Untrusted artifact processor worker<br/>Scoped read / write / transcribe<br/>No fetch capability]
  P -->|1+ manifests| V[Trusted host publication<br/>Validate all artifact memberships<br/>Atomically create items]
  V --> S[Host storage + per-item artifact sets<br/>Explicit sharing allowed]
  S --> UI[Trusted host UI per item<br/>Search + readable fallback<br/>Broker checks item membership]
  UI <-->|MessagePort: artifact reads only| F[Optional untrusted iframe<br/>Opaque origin / sandbox / CSP]
  W[Artifact processor worker<br/>Dynamic Worker; no ambient network<br/>Scoped host operations]
